Begin
torch: 2.5.1+cu124
torch cuda: 12.4
cuda available: True
gpu: NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 Ti
usage: transcriptformer inference [-h] --checkpoint-path CHECKPOINT_PATH
                                  --data-file DATA_FILE
                                  [--output-path OUTPUT_PATH]
                                  [--output-filename OUTPUT_FILENAME]
                                  [--batch-size BATCH_SIZE]
                                  [--gene-col-name GENE_COL_NAME]
                                  [--precision {16-mixed,32}]
                                  [--pretrained-embedding PRETRAINED_EMBEDDING]
                                  [--clip-counts CLIP_COUNTS]
                                  [--filter-to-vocabs]
                                  [--model-type {transcriptformer,esm2ce}]
                                  [--use-raw USE_RAW] [--emb-type {cell,cge}]
                                  [--remove-duplicate-genes]
                                  [--num-gpus NUM_GPUS]
                                  [--device {auto,cpu,cuda,mps}]
                                  [--disable-compile-block-mask]
                                  [--oom-dataloader]
                                  [--n-data-workers N_DATA_WORKERS]
                                  [--config-override CONFIG_OVERRIDE]

Run inference with a TranscriptFormer model on scRNA-seq data.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --checkpoint-path CHECKPOINT_PATH
                        Path to the model checkpoint directory
  --data-file DATA_FILE
                        Path to input AnnData file to run inference on
  --output-path OUTPUT_PATH
                        Directory where results will be saved (default:
                        ./inference_results)
  --output-filename OUTPUT_FILENAME
                        Filename for the output embeddings (default:
                        embeddings.h5ad)
  --batch-size BATCH_SIZE
                        Number of samples to process in each batch (default:
                        8)
  --gene-col-name GENE_COL_NAME
                        Column name in AnnData.var containing gene identifiers
                        (default: ensembl_id)
  --precision {16-mixed,32}
                        Numerical precision for inference (default: 16-mixed)
  --pretrained-embedding PRETRAINED_EMBEDDING
                        Path to pretrained embeddings for out-of-distribution
                        species
  --clip-counts CLIP_COUNTS
                        Maximum count value (higher values will be clipped)
                        (default: 30)
  --filter-to-vocabs    Whether to filter genes to only those in the
                        vocabulary (default: True)
  --model-type {transcriptformer,esm2ce}
                        Type of model to use for inference (default:
                        transcriptformer)
  --use-raw USE_RAW     Whether to use raw counts from AnnData.raw.X (True),
                        adata.X (False), or auto-detect (None/auto) (default:
                        None)
  --emb-type {cell,cge}
                        Type of embeddings to extract: 'cell' for mean-pooled
                        cell embeddings or 'cge' for contextual gene
                        embeddings (default: cell)
  --remove-duplicate-genes
                        Remove duplicate genes if found instead of raising an
                        error (default: False)
  --num-gpus NUM_GPUS   Number of GPUs to use for inference (1 = single GPU,
                        -1 = all available GPUs, >1 = specific number)
                        (default: 1)
  --device {auto,cpu,cuda,mps}
                        Specific device to use for inference: 'auto' (best
                        available), 'cpu', 'cuda', 'mps' (default: auto)
  --disable-compile-block-mask
                        Disable compilation of block mask creation (useful for
                        CPU or debugging)
  --oom-dataloader      Use map-style out-of-memory DataLoader
                        (DistributedSampler-friendly)
  --n-data-workers N_DATA_WORKERS
                        Number of DataLoader workers per process (map-style
                        dataset is order-safe).
  --config-override CONFIG_OVERRIDE
                        Override any configuration value not covered by the
                        explicit arguments above. Format: key.path=value
finished
